WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:03.766
Unit seventeen. Digital Drawing!

2
00:00:04.685 --> 00:00:09.266
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:12.674
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.724 --> 00:00:16.500
Today we learn about Digital Drawing. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:21.519
Draw. Say it with me. Draw!

6
00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:29.259
Digital art. Say it with me. Digital art!

7
00:00:32.723 --> 00:00:36.379
Color. Say it with me. Color!

8
00:00:39.932 --> 00:00:43.797
Brush tool. Say it with me. Brush tool!

9
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.421
Canvas. Say it with me. Canvas!

10
00:00:54.913 --> 00:00:58.480
Create. Say it with me. Create!

11
00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:05.870
Undo. Say it with me. Undo!

12
00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.142
Save. Say it with me. Save!

13
00:01:16.629 --> 00:01:27.222
Digital drawing lets me create art on a screen. I choose a color and brush tool to draw on a digital canvas. I can undo a mistake easily.

14
00:01:27.272 --> 00:01:30.472
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:31.197 --> 00:01:36.642
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.692 --> 00:01:37.842
Color!

17
00:01:38.612 --> 00:01:44.411
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.461 --> 00:01:45.611
Undo!

19
00:01:46.442 --> 00:01:54.544
Did you know? Digital drawing lets you undo a mistake instantly, which is much harder to do with paper and pencil!

20
00:01:54.594 --> 00:01:56.974
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:57.888 --> 00:02:06.772
Think and answer. What would you like to draw using a digital drawing app?

22
00:02:06.822 --> 00:02:07.972
Great answer!

23
00:02:09.011 --> 00:02:14.716
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:14.766 --> 00:02:17.942
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

